# Test-only dependency for the site runtime render contract. The published
# site bundles nothing; this is never shipped.
node_modules/
# Anchored to docs/site on purpose. Unanchored, this matched the ROOT
# package-lock.json too -- the Electron app's own lockfile -- so it was never
# committed, and CI's setup-node cache and `npm ci` both failed on a repository
# that looked complete. Same shape as the unanchored 'build/' further up: a
# pattern written for one directory quietly matching another.
docs/site/package-lock.json

